{"4651280": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Bahgonia", "steam_appid": 4651280, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "controller_support": "full", "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4651280/extras/242128128a285c2b9c94de58fe94d2ee.poster.avif?t=1785869968\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4651280/extras/242128128a285c2b9c94de58fe94d2ee.webm?t=1785869968\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4651280/extras/242128128a285c2b9c94de58fe94d2ee.mp4?t=1785869968\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Challenging Gameplay</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The world of Bahgonia is divided into levels you must escape from. In each level, the Meyers will try to stop you by relentlessly chasing you and tearing you down with insults. Use the abilities you acquire throughout the game to deal with them: push them, drag them, attack them, shoot them, outsmart them, send them flying, and more. All of this to activate the level’s exit portal. Each level is a new challenge where you’ll need to not only solve it but also put your skills to the test.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4651280/extras/7c7e46c5fa9fb468e9eb5abfd4671da6.poster.avif?t=1785869968\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4651280/extras/7c7e46c5fa9fb468e9eb5abfd4671da6.webm?t=1785869968\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4651280/extras/7c7e46c5fa9fb468e9eb5abfd4671da6.mp4?t=1785869968\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>A Journey of Discovery</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Your visit to Bahgonia is an unforgettable journey of transformation in which you will face your own fears. An existential experience where every mechanic is fully designed to evoke emotions such as fear, anxiety, revenge, catharsis, acceptance, love, and humor. And all of it is part of that transformation.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Nothing will ever be the same again.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4651280/extras/426db56a36fc86118c76c0f34c157c1b.poster.avif?t=1785869968\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4651280/extras/426db56a36fc86118c76c0f34c157c1b.webm?t=1785869968\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4651280/extras/426db56a36fc86118c76c0f34c157c1b.mp4?t=1785869968\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>A Surreal World</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Step into the dreamlike world of Bahgonia. Discover its secrets and the meaning behind everything you see. Everything has a reason and a purpose—uncover the hidden meaning of why Bahgonia is the way it is. A unique world where not everything is what it seems. A world that deconstructs reality to present concepts and symbols that will guide you on your journey.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4651280/extras/7d56d111aada978538517b93c4e22dcb.poster.avif?t=1785869968\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4651280/extras/7d56d111aada978538517b93c4e22dcb.webm?t=1785869968\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4651280/extras/7d56d111aada978538517b93c4e22dcb.mp4?t=1785869968\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>", "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4651280/extras/242128128a285c2b9c94de58fe94d2ee.poster.avif?t=1785869968\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4651280/extras/242128128a285c2b9c94de58fe94d2ee.webm?t=1785869968\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4651280/extras/242128128a285c2b9c94de58fe94d2ee.mp4?t=1785869968\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Challenging Gameplay</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The world of Bahgonia is divided into levels you must escape from. In each level, the Meyers will try to stop you by relentlessly chasing you and tearing you down with insults. Use the abilities you acquire throughout the game to deal with them: push them, drag them, attack them, shoot them, outsmart them, send them flying, and more. All of this to activate the level’s exit portal. Each level is a new challenge where you’ll need to not only solve it but also put your skills to the test.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragrap